<script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0wkx.-alh9cgb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0d~1c0xd1vt_0.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0ygqm1brujpvt.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0i9ky7uu~7o~..js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"black-translucent\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"2QT\"/><link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://ik.imagekit.io\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://checkout.razorpay.com\"/><link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://api.razorpay.com\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#FF6B35\"/><title>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy — 2QT | 2QT</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Understand how cancellations and refunds work on the 2QT food delivery platform.\"/><link rel=\"author\" href=\"https://www.go2qt.com\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"2QT\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"food delivery Ranchi,food delivery Lalpur,online food order Ranchi,premium meal delivery Ranchi,2QT food delivery,fast food delivery Ranchi,best restaurant Lalpur,2QT food\"/><meta name=\"creator\" content=\"2QT\"/><meta name=\"publisher\" content=\"2QT\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta name=\"googlebot\" content=\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large\"/><meta name=\"category\" content=\"food\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.go2qt.com\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"2QT — Next-Level Food Delivery in Ranchi\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Next-level food delivery in Ranchi. Our own kitchen, uncompromising quality, and fast delivery across Lalpur.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.go2qt.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"2QT\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_IN\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.go2qt.com/og-image.jpg\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"798\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"2QT — Premium Gourmet Delivery\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@2qt_food\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"2QT — Next-Level Food Delivery in Ranchi\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Next-level food delivery in Ranchi. Our own kitchen, uncompromising quality, and fast delivery across Lalpur.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.go2qt.com/og-image.jpg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0tcjjflmuah~3.ico\" sizes=\"48x48\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon-192x192.png\" sizes=\"192x192\" type=\"image/png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\" sizes=\"180x180\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-full flex flex-col bg-white text-zinc-900 selection:bg-swish-green/20 inter_c15e96cb-module__0bjUvq__variable space_grotesk_11bf8cd-module__L78yXa__variable playfair_display_sc_5e3b18e-module__xlQCJW__variable karla_63dab6a4-module__byI9uG__variable\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#05050A] text-zinc-300\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16\"><a class=\"text-[#FF6B35] text-sm hover:underline mb-8 inline-block\" href=\"/\">← Back to Home</a><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1><p class=\"text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-10\">Last updated: August 2026</p><div class=\"space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed\"><section class=\"bg-[#FF6B35]/10 border border-[#FF6B35]/30 rounded-2xl p-5\"><p class=\"text-[#FF6B35] font-semibold mb-1\">Quick Summary</p><p class=\"text-zinc-300\">Cancel before the kitchen starts preparing → full refund to wallet. Cancel after → no refund for food cost. Wrong item or quality issue → instant refund, no questions asked.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">1. Order Cancellation by You</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><p class=\"text-green-400 font-semibold mb-1\">Before kitchen starts preparing (within ~2 minutes of placing)</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400\">Full refund to your 2QT Wallet. Wallet credits are available instantly and can be used on your next order.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><p class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-1\">After kitchen has started preparing</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400\">Cancellation may not be possible once preparation has begun. If cancellation is accepted, a partial refund (excluding food preparation cost) may be issued at our discretion.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><p class=\"text-red-400 font-semibold mb-1\">After the order is out for delivery</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400\">Cancellation is not available. The order cannot be recalled once a rider has picked it up.</p></div></div></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">2. Order Cancellation by Us</h2><p class=\"mb-2\">We may cancel your order in the following situations, with a full refund:</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\"><li>Kitchen is temporarily unavailable or has closed</li><li>Items ordered are out of stock</li><li>No delivery rider is available in your area</li><li>Suspected fraudulent activity or payment failure</li><li>Delivery address is outside our service zone</li><li>Extreme weather or force majeure events</li></ul><p class=\"mt-2\">In all such cases, a full refund will be credited to your 2QT Wallet within 5–10 minutes.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">3. Refunds for Issues with Your Order</h2><p class=\"mb-3\">We take food quality seriously. If there is an issue with your delivered order, you are eligible for a refund or replacement:</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-3 bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium text-xs\">Wrong item delivered</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs mt-0.5\">Full refund to wallet or free re-delivery</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium text-xs\">Item missing from order</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs mt-0.5\">Refund for the missing item(s) to wallet</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium text-xs\">Food quality issue (spoiled, foreign object)</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs mt-0.5\">Full refund + escalation to kitchen</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium text-xs\">Order significantly delayed (&gt;60 min past ETA)</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs mt-0.5\">Partial refund or discount coupon at our discretion</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-3 bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><p class=\"text-white font-medium text-xs\">Order not received</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-xs mt-0.5\">Full refund after verification</p></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-zinc-500 text-xs\">Raise an issue within 24 hours of delivery via the app&#x27;s Help section or at <a href=\"mailto:support@go2qt.com\" class=\"text-[#FF6B35] hover:underline\">support@go2qt.com</a>. We may request photo evidence for quality complaints.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">4. Refund Methods</h2><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><p class=\"text-white font-semibold mb-1\">2QT Wallet (Default)</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400\">Instant. Wallet balance can be used for any future order on 2QT. This is the fastest refund method.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white/5 rounded-xl p-4\"><p class=\"text-white font-semibold mb-1\">Original Payment Method</p><p class=\"text-zinc-400\">Available on request for orders paid via UPI/card. Processing time: 5–7 business days (as per Razorpay&#x27;s refund timeline). Requires approval from our finance team.</p></div></div></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">5. Subscription Plans</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\"><li>Subscription plans (weekly/monthly meal plans) are non-refundable once activated and the first meal has been delivered.</li><li>If you have not used any meals, you may request a full refund within 24 hours of purchase.</li><li>Unused meals at the end of a subscription period are not carried forward or refunded.</li><li>We may pause your subscription if kitchen operations are temporarily unavailable in your zone.</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">6. Wallet Balance</h2><ul class=\"space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-zinc-400\"><li>Wallet balance cannot be withdrawn or transferred to a bank account.</li><li>Wallet credits are valid for 12 months from the date of credit.</li><li>Promotional wallet credits may have shorter validity — check the credit description in the app.</li></ul></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">7. How to Request a Refund</h2><ol class=\"space-y-2 list-decimal list-inside text-zinc-400\"><li>Open the 2QT app → Orders → Select your order</li><li>Tap &quot;Help with this order&quot; or &quot;Report an issue&quot;</li><li>Select the relevant issue type</li><li>Our team reviews and processes eligible refunds within 1 business day</li></ol><p class=\"mt-2\">You can also email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@go2qt.com\" class=\"text-[#FF6B35] hover:underline\">support@go2qt.com</a> with your order ID and issue description.</p></section><section><h2 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-base mb-3\">8. Disputes</h2><p>If you believe a refund decision was incorrect, you may escalate by emailing <a href=\"mailto:support@go2qt.com\" class=\"text-[#FF6B35] hover:underline\">support@go2qt.com</a> with subject line &quot;Refund Dispute — [Order ID]&quot;. We aim to resolve all disputes within 3 business days. Unresolved disputes are subject to the Consumer Protection Act 2019 and jurisdiction of courts in India.</p></section></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><section aria-label=\"Notifications alt+T\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-relevant=\"additions text\" aria-atomic=\"false\"></section><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0qylyr3x2u6aq.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[79520,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0l3e3_l-y9g0_.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0b.7u-uqjiygs.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0wkx.-alh9cgb.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d~1c0xd1vt_0.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ygqm1brujpvt.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[96923,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0l3e3_l-y9g0_.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0b.7u-uqjiygs.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0wkx.-alh9cgb.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d~1c0xd1vt_0.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ygqm1brujpvt.js\\\"],\\\"Providers\\\"]\\n4:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0l3e3_l-y9g0_.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0b.7u-uqjiygs.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0wkx.-alh9cgb.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d~1c0xd1vt_0.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0ygqm1brujpvt.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0l3e3_l-y9g0_.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0b.7u-uqjiygs.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0wkx.-alh9cgb.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0d~1c0xd1vt_0.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0